@Ms2ger  yup, that also fixes the issue, thanks!. Though the "is a shadow realm" does imply a `[[IsShadowRealm]]` or similar internal slot on the Realm.
edit: turns out it did not, and I was mistaken in my testing :(

On a related topic to this - I just noticed https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/49342 as now the old file paths aren't there. Seems like shadow-realm-in-shadow realm was maybe removed as well on IDL harness? That was definitely finding issues in my implementation, and I suspect potential spec issues as well that I need to dig into. Are there any WPT tests which do still have shadow-realm-in-shadow-realm enabled?
